India- each box has a story to tell\n\nView Collection\nIn The News\nThe essence of ANAND captured in published stories\n\nGuilt Free Range\n\nIndulge guilt-free in our wide range of sugar-free treats, bursting with flavor and healthfulness\n\nShop Guilt Free Sweets\n\nOur Speciality\n\nhandmade sweet confections that always get a little more love!\n\nSee All\n\nAjmeri Kalakand\n\nMotichoor Laddu\n\nMysore Pak\n\nYou Can Trust Us\n\nClean, Authentic And Sustainable\nShop Our Snack Range\nSouth Indian Specials\n\nIndian Bakery\n\nTea Time Snacks\n\nIndian Biscottis\n\nNorth Indian Specials\n\nOur Story\n\nAnand's success stems from its blend of tradition, innovation, and unwavering quality. Its dynamism is fueled by a continuous effort to revamp products and packaging to align with the evolving demographics of India.\n\nAnand is dedicated to authenticity, sourcing ingredients like saffron from Kashmir for Malpua and paneer from Delhi for savory delights, proving that great taste knows no boundaries.\n\nLatest Blogs\nSeptember 12, 2025\nCorporate Gifting That Goes Beyond the Box- with Anand Sweets\nRead more\nAugust 21, 2025\nWelcoming Bappa with Sweet Traditions, Ganpati Aagman with Anand Sweets\nRead more\nApril 17, 2025\nFor the love of Mango\nRead more\nWe Are Also Available On\nSame day delivery in bangalore\nOur Range\nSweets\nDry Fruits\nGifting\nIndian Bakery\nIndian Biscottis\nSavouries\nAbout Us\nCompany\nOur Brands\nGlobal Footprint\nContact Us\nLogin\nTrack Your Order\nLegal\nTerms & Conditions\nShipping Policy\nReturn And Exchange Policy\nPrivacy Policy\nWe’d Be Happy To Assist You!\n\nSubscribe\nTiming :\n\nMonday To Saturday\n\n10:00 AM to 05:30 PM IST\n\nEmail :\n\ncare@anandsweets.net\n\nPayment Methods\nFollow Us On\n© 2026 Copyright. Anand Sweets & Savouries LLP. All Rights Reserved\n\nSite By aBox Agency",
